description	"Aggressive Jedi Kindred [Jedi] - Air

A single jedi from a typical pair. 
Aggressive support that can absorb others force powers whilst being vulnerable to physical harm.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Saber Deflect (2)
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more DMG
-- Slap ^3[CS2]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (1)
- Speed (1)
- Sense (1) 
- Protect (1) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)
^7- ^3*^7Light's Beacon (Shares Force Powers with a ^7targeted/nearby ally)
- 250% slower skill CD"
